We can now do

```
beeai run --dump-files tmp prompted-sequential-workflow '{
    "steps": [
        {"agent": "gpt-researcher", "instruction": "Write an essay about cats."},
        {"agent": "aider", "instruction": "Create a plain HTML & simple CSS styled website based on the provided essay."}
    ]
}'
```

It's not flawless but at this point it's more of a question of the existing agents capabilities -- the sequential runner does not use a LLM, it only chains out/in.
